Data tables vary by dataset, so this item ships a full payments example (filtering, sorting,
pagination, column visibility, row selection, and row actions) you can adapt.

Requires TanStack Table **v9** (`@tanstack/svelte-table`) and the **table**, **dropdown-menu**,
**button**, **checkbox**, and **input** registry items.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import DataTable from '~/components/data-table/data-table.svelte';
</script>

<DataTable />
```
